SOAPBOX: lot more 1 pointers on the high bands and 2 pointers on the low bands
SOAPBOX: and lower 3 and 6 pointers compared to 2024. I did work a couple new
SOAPBOX: DXC for RTTY, so there's a win! 90% S&P, 10% struggling to get runs going
