SOAPBOX: here and there when I'd find a hole between stations. 40 and 80 were noisy
SOAPBOX: here Saturday night with the approaching rain storm. Rough going at times
SOAPBOX: getting exchanges the first time. Always a fun contest and I try not to miss
SOAPBOX: it. 73, Gene N9TF
